Package: DynMSR
Title: Toolkit for Working with DynMS Models in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Evgeny", family = "Metelkin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "evgeny.metelkin@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Provides tools to read, validate, normalize, and export models
    stored in the DynMS format. DynMSR is intended as an interoperability
    toolkit between DynMS and R modeling backends such as deSolve and
    mrgsolve.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    whisker
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/hetalang/DynMSR
BugReports: https://github.com/hetalang/DynMSR/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
